{"4469440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Particle Box", "steam_appid": 4469440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/extras/9a0a5b0234c9505abe6ef987879e4b06.poster.avif?t=1773680134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/extras/9a0a5b0234c9505abe6ef987879e4b06.webm?t=1773680134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/extras/9a0a5b0234c9505abe6ef987879e4b06.mp4?t=1773680134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to the Particle Box room, intern #6407. Your job is to generate electricity using a newly developed Particle Box, which consists of particle-emitting modules in a 3D grid. Combine the effects of 35+ unique modules to create synergies, begin chain reactions, and narrowly pass your session target. <br> <br>In this  incremental roguelite, you'll have to learn to adapt to modules that are available to you in the shop, and strategize to turn a given run's probability into profitability. Don't worry if you fail at first though – you'll be able to unlock new modules to progress between runs. Once you get the hang of getting your B-Type Deterministic Amplifier and TS-47 Laser Ring to endlessly energize your Nondeterministic Fission Core, you'll be generating 10^35+ g-particles in no time!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/extras/9a0a5b0234c9505abe6ef987879e4b06.poster.avif?t=1773680134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/extras/9a0a5b0234c9505abe6ef987879e4b06.webm?t=1773680134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/extras/9a0a5b0234c9505abe6ef987879e4b06.mp4?t=1773680134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to the Particle Box room, intern #6407. Your job is to generate electricity using a newly developed Particle Box, which consists of particle-emitting modules in a 3D grid. Combine the effects of 35+ unique modules to create synergies, begin chain reactions, and narrowly pass your session target. <br> <br>In this  incremental roguelite, you'll have to learn to adapt to modules that are available to you in the shop, and strategize to turn a given run's probability into profitability. Don't worry if you fail at first though – you'll be able to unlock new modules to progress between runs. Once you get the hang of getting your B-Type Deterministic Amplifier and TS-47 Laser Ring to endlessly energize your Nondeterministic Fission Core, you'll be generating 10^35+ g-particles in no time!</p>", "short_description": "A strategic incremental game about using scientific-sounding probabilistic particle interactions to make a number go up. Generate quettawatt-hours of electricity in the Particle Box room and get promoted to Senior Staff Intern.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/f8d21bc16d0380c3755f36f370e3b0db49f1a3ad/header.jpg?t=1773680134", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/af67bb901ab35014b9487e984136aaf61c86a43b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773680134", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4469440/af67bb901ab35014b9487e984136aaf61c86a43b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773680134", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor